<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-BELGIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELGIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Belgian first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p> Lommel		 1	Lokeren	     0</p>
<p> Anderlecht	   0	Mechelen	    0</p>
<p> Antwerp		2	Ekeren		0</p>
<p> Lierse		 2	Standard Liege    1</p>
<p> Sint Truiden	 1	Genk		  1</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p> Ghent		  1	Club Brugge	 3</p>
